### AI Crime Scene Sketch Generator API Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8787
@userId = usr_investigator_1

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. Create Case
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "West Midtown Convenience Store Robbery",
  "caseNumber": "CR-2026-1182",
  "description": "Male suspect, approx 35 years old, athletic build, high forehead, distinct dark circles under eyes",
  "incidentDate": "2026-10-28T03:15:00Z"
}

### 3. List Cases
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### 4. Get Case Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/case_sample_001
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### 5. Generate Candidate Sketches (Single or Multiple)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/generations
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "caseId": "case_sample_001",
  "prompt": "Forensic charcoal sketch of male suspect in mid-30s, prominent brow, round jawline, thin lips",
  "negativePrompt": "photograph, color, cartoon, anime",
  "modelName": "mock-forensic-pencil-v1",
  "numCandidates": 3,
  "parameters": {
    "guidanceScale": 7.5,
    "numInferenceSteps": 25
  }
}

### 6. Get Image Metadata (Replace with generated image ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/images/img_sample_id
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### 7. Stream Image Binary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/images/img_sample_id/file
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### 8. Region Edit using Mask (Inpainting)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/images/img_sample_id/edits
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "prompt": "Make jawline significantly sharper and more square",
  "facialRegions": ["jawline", "chin"],
  "mask": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mP8z8BQDwAEhQGAhKmMIQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==",
  "modelName": "mock-forensic-pencil-v1"
}

### 9. Get Revision History for Case
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/case_sample_001/versions
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### 10. Restore Previous Version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/images/img_sample_id/restore
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### 11. View Case Audit Log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/case_sample_001/audit
x-user-id: {{userId}}

